      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c661bfdb5ba767c9fe6d9ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ce2b28fce2b628ee4336d2632ad4703ebea32f5045942c21aefec34af94968",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1309ac5819fe33ec2f42d358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77acb47729112a669295cf14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec634000510a468bf0c203a32955f8df432a6fc63b80c98ff19fcd03a69f626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5465716d3c166262fa2a81a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b33e754eb08f945fcd738627973ee0906ef6b3553b24c13a31de6648224dd0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77645d60753e37f0f69db5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08b4fa03f5ad27bf80c41e81418ab7f79cf8e703f971fc41d72b1df9342c066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff0191b4c6565e8ef1fc38b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8022c5dd06a75063d377e64b71d4835e3cff8736eb76496bafccb8660881689f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f164d6939137d6eab4a571",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7d1e97042f6e694e9d045e354f733c9f1d97c54ec0a7c3f42f1552f0046e85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94631cd523684a475d971796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "339b4994041b8d66e6603c6b2af7794afd339928fe9d28b08b3235a52c27e5cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f03065395b68b2d059051c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的意外惊喜好像是这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1891a2d6faf7f4cfc47bc28b638bd8575c60a670d58369644340fa534435fbfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5a3dad7dde4fb76c36f984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……体、体力已经……\r\n我好像太高估自己的能力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9b2605875945a3331669bbd08fe5f360c3dfed7c866fc0074897299570ddaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2083c2b2b8a4541ffb4ac95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是休息为吉哦，\r\n所以要不要休息呢……？\r\n我也有点疲倦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3d64642effd01407d83851b31a1cffa0c742d1ae6525c0954e32a4edd16a19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7d8ab7c02c96dfa4c3df16e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯哼──！充满了神灵力量呢！\r\n现在的我什么都能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "051580214f5af3e94755e21b78ed7d7389a254591b4435648b6e1cc327c3506d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace1d7e2b11ca36c137c0ee6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听我说！我今天的运势是\r\n超越了大吉的超吉呢！！\r\n呵呵呵，现在的我是无敌的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ae2bd92c6bd28a69de7624859fdd33b3f113a01c4d1d47cb96effaf44d9a477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072945164cfd0e50f323f2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "占卜结果显示，今天努力为吉！\r\n哼哼，不管是什么训练都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "848bb3621b2e182b0920be03a03241e398f80375542916710b9f4dd36168d26a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e3f3240203ae50621699ff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚筷子拆的非常漂亮，\r\n所以今天的我感觉不错哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd215772078a0c8fee296f3221cbad1541b08f5459015c3007b409a4a292072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a783d14bead395dc3fb76f32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的运势是不好也不坏。\r\n但都说普通才是最好的状态嘛，\r\n我们还是适度努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b4f18bf66bddbba51caa57dac74e039bd3f8916ab7d2745f7f41fa12e7f9b36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52653be878f27851fca5f85d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Shiraoki大人、Shiraoki大人，\r\n请您今天也要守护着我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "908ff827369ea6aa0b80f6d622d9c07b9507e274e66bd648425ed9fe18da7f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c1bf822416a0bfe14ddbb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我抽签抽到凶了……\r\n害我在意到都没办法专心训练了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f45bc0fcc8647f5c2e4bb38396185bb65142f1cd0d324487851685bd52bf59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d755902370b5ce71110affa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一直发生运气不好的事情……\r\n难道是福气跑掉了吗……呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "362eb47d95df1f0c1fc9ca629ff56d5910549de685f1e24742d9e0e1c421ebca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aed90494fc0e1af20584dfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "占卜运势倒数第一……抽签又\r\n抽到大凶……还遇到黑猫横越面前\r\n──我、我不行了～～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dce709e051324c759a472e99bb6de5335904bad88ca2f0e04c8b44d07b4ad6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fc6b8108b0dbfcc78f97b56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……身体好沉重……\r\n感觉神灵力量……\r\n好像不够了……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b03507834cbaee4185396640813ed03f1f4439a3092be65ada6d7302dbf407e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e565bc9e6ce8ba5cd890d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直在参加比赛，没问题吗……\r\n占卜结果显示「一直重复做\r\n一样的事情会使运气下降」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a39f2aaddacb106bdad8a8099e75a8b5e39bff73caafeaad473fd7b209204bf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b0457232f7b5d2b1fe6a01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还是这次就不要报名参赛了吧……？\r\n最近一直连续在比赛……\r\n而且今天的胜负运是最后一名……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f36efea10f253f34f5d64dbb8a81255555c946aeaf3062ed4be295806bc2a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5675d25f8c0dcfd1aa932a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运势超棒的！占卜结果大吉！\r\n我现在无人能敌了！\r\n现在不管参加什么比赛都感觉能赢哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c388c44156b8f04d2b8ff870cd041078556ec56d86a9ac1f0633b3433e125da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75a790ca2857dd253273581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然梦到跟Shiraoki大人一起奔跑……！\r\n如此大吉之梦……\r\n等同于是宣布我已经赢了的意思！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2f682b6cbe2fb9c463d10fc340b10c9ed1f5a1f78b579609412a0664e9880b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57253cd840201dad59f2d21e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好惊人……！不管是哪种占卜，\r\n结果都全是好的……！\r\n我完全没有会输的可能！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "856a5ea7f76badd627198e0717e4047aabf5516b9fefc7fc643962cf98696afe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5232002f7acb8c6b03da2808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负运很不错哦！\r\n感觉比赛时也能好好发挥实力哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ad34c75f42f9ba89bfa598664867efe4f2e521feb69ccd196bb0da758dae3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c8412ce4c21d2ff1ab54c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神灵力量已经补充完成了！\r\n这都是因为有去能量景点的关系呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dbc7c4687d8b07ca256b524b4505c2773d4c718eed2e3cb535a2982569f0937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "20027"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
